  "description": "“I learned… from books. After all, I am a prince.”\n\nHyoun felt hot again.  \nA handsome dragon prince as if carved from jade was on her lower abdomen.  \nAnyone who sees her rubbing her forehead like a puppy will do so.\n\n\"ah…\"  \n“But now I think I’m glad I took that class. I learned how to cherish Jeongin.”\n\n=\n\nHyo-un, who lives in her male attire, picks up her snails while farming.  \nIt turns out that this snail,  \nAlthough he was the son of the Dragon King of the West Sea, he ran away from home.\n\nThey say that you can only live if people on land accept you.  \nI cook well and do housework well!  \nEven the beauty is amazing!\n\nHow easy would it be to meet such a beauty? Ah, not this.  \nShall I accept it first?\n\n“You have to pretend to be my wife.”  \n\"yes?\"  \n“So, you have to be dressed as a woman.”  \n“I… do you mean me? Why?”  \n“Because I need it.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8739534), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68562323), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4883001188), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/snail_19), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/snail_husband), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078991)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8739532), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68562286), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4883001189), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/snail_15), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/snail_husband_15), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078992) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance/the-river-snail-prince/list?title_no=6027)",
